    "file": "songs/2016-painter.md",
    "raw": "---\nid: \"painter\"\ntitle: \"Painter\"\nalt_title: \"Colour Me\"\nyear: 2016\ncamp: \"CCM16: Colour\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"Ephesians 5:13 • Matthew 5:14–16\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Kevin Tedy & Ingrid Kurniawan\"\nlyricists: \"Kevin Tedy & Ingrid Kurniawan\"\ncomposers: \"Kevin Tedy & Ingrid Kurniawan\"\nperformers: \"Kevin Tedy (Vocal), Ingrid Kurniawan (Piano), Marcel Anderti (EG), Nathan Prajogo (Bass), Timothy Noah (Drum)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified on official Sounds of Joy YouTube release & CCM16 Colours Handbook.\"\nkey: \"G\"\nkey_verified: false\nkey_note: \"\"\nchord_status: \"lyrics-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ocNymHXZzdI\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files: []\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM16 Colours Handbook\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dF5cnlD6oMT3vDYypNtlJdRQldFUQjcykiAO9Wuf_9o/edit\"\n---\n\n## Verse\nJesus, Thy Love beyond compare  \nSpeak to me, pierce my heart  \nAnd make it whole  \nThy river, runs wild and never dry\n\n## Chorus\nLord here I am  \nI surrender to Your arm  \nUse me for Your glory  \nSo take control now  \nOh I am changed  \nFull of colours through Your works  \nI used to be nothing  \nBut You turned me into light\n\n## Bridge\nColour me, Colour me  \nI will use what You’ve given me  \nAll honour and all glory  \nTo Your Name forever\n"
