    "raw": "---\nid: \"a-song-for-you\"\ntitle: \"A Song for You\"\nalt_title: \"\"\nyear: 2018\ncamp: \"POJ Praise & Worship (2018)\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"\"\ncredits: \"POJ Praise & Worship Team • Sounds of Joy\"\nlyricists: \"POJ Praise & Worship Team\"\ncomposers: \"POJ Praise & Worship Team\"\nperformers: \"Sounds of Joy (Published Sep 29, 2018)\"\ncredit_note: \"Individual songwriter names were not itemized on YouTube; contact arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au to add.\"\nkey: \"G\"\nkey_verified: false\nkey_note: \"\"\nchord_status: \"lyrics-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6DKcT2Jvif4\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files: []\ndrive_links: []\n---\n\n## Verse\nWe come to your presence Lord  \nAs we bring the best we have in our life  \nForever We'll declare Your Name\n\nWe come to your presence Lord  \nAs we bring the best we have in our life  \nForever We'll declare Your Name\n\n## Pre-Chorus\nFrom the deepest of our hearts  \nWe'll say  \nOooooo\n\n## Chorus\nYou are our King, You are our God Almighty  \nSinging Dancing, together we praise You always  \nYou are our King, You are our God Almighty  \nWe shout our voice, in the Name of Jesus\n\n## Bridge\nLet Your Name, Be Lifted High  \nLet Our King, Be Glorified  \nVictory, is all we Got  \nIn Your Name  \nForevermore\n"
